\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs28 UYAN ARTIK\lang1033\b0\f2\fs22\par
Yanki \lang1055\f0 [Siyonist Yanki] \lang1033\f2\'e7\u305?kt\u305?\lang1055\f0 , \lang1033\f2 b\'fct\'fcn d\'fcnyan\u305?n g\'f6zleri \'f6n\'fcnde \i "Erdo\u287?an \lang1055\f0 n\lang1033\f2 e istersek yap\u305?yor, \lang1055\f0 n\lang1033\f2 e istersek veriyor\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Manda \lang1055\f0 [Vasal, Manda-torily] \lang1033\f2 diyor ki\lang1055\f0 ,\lang1033\f2  \i "Erdo\u287?an d\'fcnya lideri\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2 "\i0\par
Yanki \'e7\u305?kt\u305?\lang1055\f0 , \lang1033\f2 b\'fct\'fcn d\'fcnyan\u305?n g\'f6zleri \'f6n\'fcnde \i "Ortado\u287?u\rquote ya \'baekil verirken Erdo\u287?an\rquote\u305?n \lang1055\f0\'e7\lang1033\f2 ok yard\u305?m\u305?n\u305? g\'f6rd\'fck, bundan sonra\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\f2 da g\'f6rece\u287?iz\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2  Manda \'e7\u305?kt\u305?\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\i\f2 "Erdo\u287?an orta do\u287?uya \'baekil veriyor\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2\par
Yanki \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "\lang1055\f0 BOP \lang1033\f2 B\'fcy\'fck \lang1055\f0 O\lang1033\f2 rtado\u287?u \lang1055\f0 P\lang1033\f2 lan\u305?m\u305?z\u305?n oda\u287?\u305?nda \u304?srail\rquote in g\'fcvenli\u287?i \lang1055\f0 v\lang1033\f2 e geni\'balemesi var. Erdo\u287?an\rquote la beraber \'e7al\u305?\'bamaktan gurur duyuyoruz\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Manda \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Erdo\u287?an \u304?srail\rquote i \lang1055\f0 v\lang1033\f2 e Amerikay\u305? dize getirdi\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2\par
Yanki \'e7\u305?kt\u305? "\i Suriye\rquote de her \'baey bizim kontrol\'fcm\'fczde\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2  Manda \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Erdo\u287?an Suriye Fatih\rquote i\rdblquote\i0  \lang1055\f0 d\lang1033\f2 ed\lang1055\f0 i.\lang1033\f2\par
Yanki \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Aylarca Erdo\u287?an\rquote la g\'f6r\'fc\'bamem\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2  Ve nihayetinde \i "Amerikaya gelmesine \u304?zin verdik\ldblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2  Erdo\u287?an gidince de \i "kuca\u287?\u305?nda onlarca tavizle geldi, 220 Boing sipari\'bai verdi,\lang1055\f0  k\lang1033\f2\u305?ymetli madenleri d\'fc\'ba\'fck vergiyle \lang1055\f0 i\lang1033\f2\'baletme ayr\u305?cal\u305?\u287?\u305? tan\u305?d\u305?\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2  Manda \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Erdo\u287?an Amerika\rquote y\u305? da fethetti \rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2\par
Yanki \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "O bize ne istersek verdi biz\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\f2 de ona ME\'aaRU\u304?YET verdik\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 ,\lang1033\f2  yani kalmas\u305?na izin verdik demeye getirdi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Peki T\'fcrkiye ne ald\u305? denilince \i\ldblquote Me\'baruiyet yetmez mi\lang1055\f0 ?\lang1033\f2\rdblquote\i0  diye tekrarlad\u305?\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Manda \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Trump Erdo\u287?an\rquote dan ak\u305?l al\u305?yor\rdblquote\lang1055\i0\f0  \lang1033\f2 dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2\par
Yanki \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Ege\rquote de petrol aramayacaks\u305?n\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 O\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\f2 da aramay\u305? durdurdu\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\i\f2 "Mavi vatan\u305? unut\rdblquote\i0 dedi\lang1055\f0 . O da \lang1033\f2  unuttu\lang1055\f0 .\par
\lang1033\f2 Erdo\u287?an \i "Katil Sisi\lang1055\f0  [Bibi, Netanyahu, Yanki Trump'\'fdn siyon nebisi]\lang1033\f2\rquote yle asla  bulu\'bamam"\i0  demi\'bati\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Trump \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "S\u304?S\u304?\lang1055\f0 '\lang1033\f2 YLE g\'f6r\'fc\'baeceksin\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . [Trump'\'fdn gayrime\'feru manda havarisi] \lang1033\f2 Erdo\u287?an gidip  g\'f6r\'fc\'bat\'fc.\par
Erdo\u287?an \i "Mitotakis benim i\'e7in bitti\lang1055\f0 ,\lang1033\f2  bir gece ans\u305?z\u305?n \lang1055\f0 [Adalara ve Selanik'e] \lang1033\f2 g\lang1055\f0 ir\lang1033\f2 ebiliri\lang1055\f0 m\lang1033\f2\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2  Trump \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Yunanistan\rquote a git ve bar\u305?\'ba\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2  O\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\f2 da gitti bar\u305?\'bat\u305?\lang1055\f0 .\par
\lang1033\f2 Erdo\u287?an \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Birle\'baik Arap Emirlikleri FET\'d6 darbesinin finansman\u305?\lang1055\f0 d\'fdr, \lang1033\f2 gerekirse sava\'ba\u305?r\u305?z\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Trump \lang1055\i\f0 "\lang1033\f2 git bar\u305?\'ba\lang1055\f0 "\lang1033\i0\f2  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 O\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\f2 da gitti bar\u305?\'bat\u305?\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2\par
Erdo\u287?an \i "Bu can bu bedende dururken Rahip Bransu\rquote yu kimse elimden  alamaz\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Trump \i "Aptal olma\lang1055\f0 ,\lang1033\f2  g\'f6nder adam\u305?\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Erdo\u287?an da g\'f6nderdi\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2\par
Erdo\u287?an \'e7\u305?kt\u305? \i "Ka\'ba\u305?k\'e7\u305? cinayet dosyas\u305?n\u305? asla vermeyiz\rdblquote\i0  dedi\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Geldi elin adam\u305?\lang1055\f0 ,\lang1033\f2  t\u305?p\u305?\'ba t\u305?p\u305?\'ba ald\u305?. \par
\lang1055\f0 ...\lang1033\f2 Bu liste daha \'e7ok uzar dostlar.\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\f2 Hepsini yazarsak s\u305?k\u305?l\u305?rs\u305?n\u305?z, \lang1055\f0 k\lang1033\f2\u305?yamam size\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Zaten \lang1055\f0 mandalar\'fdn\lang1033\f2  kafas\u305? almaz bunlar\u305?\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Ey Manda\lang1055\f0 , \'fe\lang1033\f2 imdi sana Bilal\rquote e sorar gibi soraca\u287?\u305?m\lang1055\f0 : \lang1033\i\f2\ldblquote\lang1055\f0\'de\lang1033\f2 imdi bu nas\u305?l asr\u305?n lideri oluyor\lang1055\f0 ? \lang1033\f2 Nas\u305?l Amerikaya kafa tutmu\'ba oluyor\lang1055\f0 ?\lang1033\f2 "\i0\par
Bu t\'fcr sorular \'e7o\u287?alt\u305?labilir\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Ama \lang1055\f0 mandala\lang1033\f2 r anlamaz\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Z\u305?rt p\u305?rt \'e7\u305?kar\lang1055\f0 : \lang1033\f2\u304?\lang1055\f0 HA\lang1033\f2  \lang1055\f0 (\'ddnsans\'fdz Hava Arac\'fd) \lang1033\f2 yapt\u305?k\lang1055\f0 , \lang1033\f2 S\lang1055\f0\'ddHA\lang1033\f2  yapt\u305?k der\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Bire ak\u305?ls\u305?z\lang1055\f0 ... B\'ddR: \'ddHA'\lang1033\f2 lar damada para kazand\u305?ran bir \'baey\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2\u304?K\u304?:\lang1055\f0  B\lang1033\f2\'fct\'fcn par\'e7alar\u305?n\u305? Kanada\lang1055\f0 '\lang1033\f2 dan al\u305?p\lang1055\f0  sadece \lang1033\f2 mont\lang1055\f0 e\lang1033\f2  ediyoruz\lang1055\f0 . H\lang1033\f2 epsi bu.\lang1055\f0  \lang1033\f2 Ayr\u305?ca \lang1055\f0\'ddHA\lang1033\f2  dedi\u287?imiz \'baey\lang1055\f0 , \lang1033\f2 biz daha onun ad\u305?n\u305? hi\'e7 duymad\u305?\u287?\u305?m\u305?z 1965-70 y\u305?llar\u305?nda Amerika taraf\u305?ndan yap\u305?ld\u305?\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 Ve \'bau an elinde binlerce iha var\lang1055\f0 . \lang1033\f2 T\'fcrkiye hen\'fcz \lang1055\f0\'ddHA'\lang1033\f2 n\u305?n ad\u305?n\u305? bilmedi\u287?i y\u305?llarda Avrupal\u305?lar\u305?n elinde binlerce \lang1055\f0\'ddHA\lang1033\f2  vard\u305?\lang1055\f0 .\lang1033\f2\par
